        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dear&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;{!$Record.Name}&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; ,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;We hope this message finds you well .“Welcome to Event Management Team! We’re delighted to have you join us.&quot; We are excited to inform you that you have been assigned to manage the following event. Please find the event details below for your reference:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Event Details -&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Event Name&lt;/strong&gt; - {!$Record.Event_Details__r.Name}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Event Start Date - &lt;/strong&gt;{!$Record.Event_Start_Date__c}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;  Event End Date-  &lt;/strong&gt;{!$Record.Event_End_Date__c}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;  &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;u&gt;Event Managers Details -&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;  Event Manager Name - &lt;/strong&gt;{!$Record.Events_Managers__r.Name}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;  Event Manager Phone - &lt;/strong&gt;{!$Record.Events_Managers__r.Phone_Number__c}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;  Event Manager Email - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Events_Managers__r.Email__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;We encourage you to review the event details and connect with the event manager for further coordination or queries. Your expertise and dedication will undoubtedly contribute to the event’s success.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; If you need any assistance, feel free to contact the Event Management Team at any time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Warm Regards,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Event Management Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
