        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dear&amp;nbsp;{!$Record.Name},&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;We hope this message finds you well. We would like to inform you that the details of the event you are managing have been updated. Please find the revised event details below for your reference:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Updated Event Details-&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt;Event Name&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt; -{!$Record.Event_Details__r.Name}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt;Event Start Date &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;{!$Record.Event_Start_Date__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt;Event End Date&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt; -&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;{!$Record.Event_End_Date__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Event Manager Information-&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt;Event Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt; -&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;{!$Record.Events_Managers__r.Name}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt;Event Manager Phone Number&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt; -&amp;nbsp;{!$Record.Events_Managers__r.Phone_Number__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt;Event Manager Email&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial;&quot;&gt; -&amp;nbsp;{!$Record.Events_Managers__r.Email__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;We kindly request you to review the updated event details and connect with the event manager for further coordination if needed. Your continued efforts and attention to these updates are greatly appreciated and essential for the event’s success.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; If you have any questions or require further assistance, please do not hesitate to reach out to the Event Management Team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Warm Regards,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Event Management Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
